_cascade` / `solve_cascade` call sites\n\n`run_cascade` definition: cascade.rs:166. `solve_cascade` definition: cascade.rs:190. Trait declaration `CascadeSolver::solve_cascade`: cascade.rs:163 (no impl exists anywhere).\n\nProduction calls:\n- `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/version.rs:93` — `run_cascade(input)?`\n- `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/snapshot.rs:66` — `crate::cascade::run_cascade(cascade_input)?`\n- `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade.rs:169` — `solve_cascade(input)` inside `run_cascade` (only call site of `solve_cascade` in the workspace)\n\nTest calls (all `run_cascade`):\n- cascade.rs 764, 846, 1016, 1144, 1309, 1472\n- cascade_tests.rs 61, 155, 211, 274, 341, 430\n\nNon-call textual mentions (comments/doc only): aggregate.rs 425, 1162; cascade.rs 158, 1233, 1348; version.rs 348, 397; lib.rs 38 (re-export).\n\n## 3. `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/config/groups.rs`\n\n`resolve` spans lines 135-233. `.insert(` calls inside it:\n- 157 `claimed_by.insert(...)` — fixed loop\n- 160 `fixed_of.insert(id, rg.name.clone())` — fixed loop\n- 176 `fixed.insert(...)` — group-def map\n- 198 `claimed_by.insert(...)` — linked loop\n- 201 `linked_of.insert(id, rg.name.clone())` — linked loop\n- 217 `linked.insert(...)` — group-def map\n\nExactly two group-kind loops in `resolve`: `for rg in &amp;raw.fixed` (145) and `for rg in &amp;raw.linked` (186). Both perform the cross-group conflict check (`claimed_by.get(&amp;id)` at 149 and 190 → `GraphError::ConflictingGroupMembership`). `RawGroupTable` (line 57-60) has only `fixed` and `linked`; `GroupKind` (callisto-model/src/identity.rs:290-293) has only `Fixed` and `Linked`. **There is no third group-kind loop in `resolve`.**\n\nOther membership-building paths in the same file:\n\n- `GroupTable::validate_syntactic` (lines 70-133), a separate earlier path over the same raw data. Inserts at 74/87 (`seen_names`), 102 (`fixed_members`), 115 (`linked_members`). It has an intra-fixed check (102), an intra-linked check (115), and a cross-group check at 121-127 (`fixed_members.get(m.as_str())` inside the linked loop). It operates on raw member *strings* before identity resolution, so it does not catch two different raw strings that resolve to the same `PackageId`.\n- `GroupTable::from_groups` (lines 259-289) — **third membership-building path, and it has NO conflict check of any kind.** Inserts at 268 (`f_of`), 271 (`f_map`), 277 (`l_of`), 280 (`l_map`). A package appearing in both a fixed and a linked `GroupDef` silently lands in both `fixed_of` and `linked_of`. Callers: napi.rs:313 (test), groups.rs:206 (test), cascade.rs:1449 (test) — currently test-only, `pub`, and re-exported via `callisto_graph::config`.\n- Direct field mutation bypassing all three constructors: cascade_tests.rs 242-243 (`groups.linked_of.insert(...)`), plus `groups.fixed/linked.insert(...)` at aggregate.rs 1193, 1240 and cascade_tests.rs 231, 319 — all test-only; `fixed_of`/`linked_of`/`fixed`/`linked` are `pub` fields (lines 12-15).\n\nOnly production entry to `resolve`: `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/lib.rs:109`. Only production entry to `validate_syntactic`: `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/config/resolve.rs:365`.\n\n## 4. `pre_mutation_checks` and `NapiTargetsIndex::load`\n\n`pre_mutation_checks` definition: `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/groups.rs:18`; re-exported at lib.rs:43.\n- Calls: `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/version.rs:84` (production — the only one); `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/groups.rs:223` (test, after `#[cfg(test)]` at 144).\n- Non-call mentions: snapshot.rs 312, 314, 316, 320, 327, 328 (all test — a test asserting the production half of snapshot.rs never mentions the string); version.rs 350, 502, 555 (test comments/messages).\n\n`NapiTargetsIndex::load` definition: `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/napi.rs:15`.\n- Calls: `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/version.rs:83` (production — the only one); `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/napi.rs:315` (test, `#[cfg(test)]` at 211); `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/groups.rs:217` (test).\n- Doc mention: `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/matrix.rs:92`.\n\nNote: `snapshot.rs` production path calls neither `NapiTargetsIndex::load` nor `pre_mutation_checks`.\n\n## 5. `CascadeInput` literal counts\n\n- `cascade.rs` `#[cfg(test)] mod tests` (begins line 596): **8** literals — 752, 834, 906, 1004, 1132, 1216, 1297, 1460. All 8 supply `tags` (7 use `&amp;TagIndex::empty()`; line 1469 uses `&amp;tags`).\n- `tests/cascade_tests.rs`: **6** literals — 49, 143, 199, 262, 329, 417. All 6 supply `tags: &amp;TagIndex::empty()`.\n\nZero `CascadeInput` literals elsewhere in either file (`cascade.rs` has no production literal; its other `CascadeInput` mentions at 135/163/167/191/444/486 are the struct def and `&amp;CascadeInput` parameter types).</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>44654</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>17</tool_uses><duration_ms>106852</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
