{"parentUuid":"1dafc6d4-74a7-443a-aab1-acca13298a17","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Ce8z2jPWoQFbnFwPqbvBa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Solid structure, well-scoped. Running canon-verifier now."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1241,"cache_read_input_tokens":558500,"output_tokens":1715,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1241,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1715,"cache_read_input_tokens":558500,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1241,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1241},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce8z2gJES3qKsMEyuGXUk","type":"assistant","uuid":"b8ec7701-3456-4dcd-876a-6bfe3af7482c","timestamp":"2026-08-17T20:53:01.066Z","effort":"high","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"b8ec7701-3456-4dcd-876a-6bfe3af7482c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Ce8z2jPWoQFbnFwPqbvBa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019Q9LGyszupYLpo4SVFSpUp","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Verify Track 2 spec grounding","subagent_type":"canon:verifier","prompt":"Verify the draft spec@1 at /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118/scratchpad/spec-track2-draft.json (id SPEC-TRACK2-PLATFORM-MANIFEST-WRITES, callisto Rust monorepo at /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto) against its source requirement@1 below. For each of the spec's 14 acceptance criteria, classify as supported, unsupported, or overfitted.\n\nSource requirement@1:\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"REQ-TRACK2-PLATFORM-MANIFEST-WRITES\",\n  \"statement\": \"Build the planning logic that populates VersionPlan.platform_writes and VersionPlan.optional_dep_updates from a Fixed group's GroupMember::PlatformManifest members and their owning package's version bump, and fix two confirmed-dormant correctness gaps in the already-landed consumption side (apply_version_plan's dispatch loops for these two fields).\",\n  \"why\": \"commands/version.rs's plan_version hardcodes both fields to Vec::new() -- nothing in production populates them. Two dormant bugs confirmed in the consumption side: (1) active_ecosystems is derived only from plan.bumps, never platform_writes/optional_dep_updates, so lockfiles wouldn't refresh/stage; (2) the platform_writes dispatch loop has no precondition check unlike sibling loops, risking silent unconditional overwrite.\",\n  \"done_when\": [\n    \"Given a Fixed group with an owner Package member and a GroupMember::PlatformManifest member, and a computed PlannedBump for the owner, plan_version produces a VersionPlan whose platform_writes contains a PlatformWrite entry tracking the owner's bump target exactly.\",\n    \"Given the same scenario, and the owner's own canonical manifest declares an optionalDependencies entry naming the platform package, plan_version's optional_dep_updates contains an entry updating that dependency to the new version.\",\n    \"Given a Fixed group with NO GroupMember::PlatformManifest members, platform_writes and optional_dep_updates remain empty Vecs.\",\n    \"Given a Fixed group's owner package receiving NO version bump this run, no PlatformWrite or OptionalDepUpdate entry is produced.\",\n    \"Fix 1: active_ecosystems is extended to also derive ecosystem membership from platform_writes/optional_dep_updates manifest paths, so lockfile refresh/staging works even when a plan contains only those fields, no bumps.\",\n    \"Fix 1 regression: an ordinary plan with only plan.bumps entries has byte-for-byte unchanged active_ecosystems/lockfile behavior.\",\n    \"Fix 2: PlatformWrite gains a `from: Version` field; the dispatch loop errors with GraphError::UnexpectedManifestVersion if the platform manifest's actual on-disk version doesn't match `from`, instead of silently overwriting.\",\n    \"Fix 2 regression: a platform manifest whose on-disk version matches `from` writes successfully exactly as before.\",\n    \"Every criterion proven through the real, live call path (plan_version / apply_version_plan), not isolated unit tests of a helper called directly.\"\n  ],\n  \"out_of_scope\": [\n    \"plan_snapshot and pr_body's own platform_writes/optional_dep_updates population -- deferred, reasoning to be confirmed against live code and stated explicitly.\",\n    \"A new planning-logic path for optionalDependencies updates unrelated to platform packages.\",\n    \"Any change to the Manifest trait, ManifestFormat::from_path, or update_optional_dependencies's own internal logic.\",\n    \"Redesigning apply_version_plan's write-batching to fold these two fields into the batched-write groups.\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nRead the full spec@1 JSON from disk for complete acceptance criteria text. Note the drafter's own report says it found the requirement's pr_body.rs framing was imprecise (pr_body.rs calls plan_version directly, has no separate producer to defer) and corrected this in the spec's non_goals/scope -- verify this correction is handled sensibly and doesn't leave a gap. Also note AC-007 (multi-target-per-owner cardinality) was added by the drafter beyond what the requirement's done_when literally enumerated -- assess whether this is a reasonable, well-grounded addition (a realistic napi-rs scenario) or unsupported scope expansion. Output a structured evidence report with supported, unsupported, and overfitted arrays plus a reasoning scratchpad."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1241,"cache_read_input_tokens":558500,"output_tokens":1715,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1241,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1715,"cache_read_input_tokens":558500,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1241,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1241},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce8z2gJES3qKsMEyuGXUk","type":"assistant","uuid":"62ae999a-e1bd-4d3f-a103-7de2aba684ff","timestamp":"2026-08-17T20:53:13.770Z","effort":"high","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
