{"parentUuid":"cd980bf1-fb81-46d3-90b2-817d2778b38b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Ce92K3j1dGWVf4FQGHTwq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AWRhu2xPoJ83K2op1xop5A","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto\ngit add .claude/specs/SPEC-TRACK2-PLATFORM-MANIFEST-WRITES.json\ngit commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\ndocs(specs): add gated spec for Track 2 platform-manifest writes\n\nBuilds the planning logic to populate VersionPlan.platform_writes and\nVersionPlan.optional_dep_updates from a Fixed group's GroupMember::\nPlatformManifest members, and fixes two dormant bugs found by adversarial\naudit in the already-landed consumption side of apply_version_plan: the\nlockfile-staging blind spot (active_ecosystems ignored these two fields)\nand the missing precondition check (platform_writes could silently\noverwrite a drifted manifest with no error).\n\nPassed canon-exit-gate on the 3rd attempt -- round 1 caught a false claim\nthat npm lockfiles get \"refreshed\" (apply_version_plan has no npm refresh\nsubprocess, only Cargo/Pypi), an underspecified OpenContext derivation\nthat would break workspace-inherited-version Cargo/maturin platform\ncrates, and two criteria asserting on non-observable internal state.\nRound 2 caught the same non-observability defect reintroduced in the\nfix for round 1's OpenContext issue, plus a self-contradictory headline\nsentence and a wrong file-path citation. Round 3 passed clean.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HxMVynBHufrDkmRHgmKgcH\nEOF\n)\""},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":414,"cache_read_input_tokens":620583,"output_tokens":576,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input