's 8 tasks correctly implement what the spec's api_surface actually requires -- not a plausible-sounding paraphrase of it. In particular: does TASK-2's OpenContext derivation genuinely match the pattern the spec's AC-002 mandates (WorkspaceCargoResolver::load + inheritance() for cargo_workspace, detect_npm_workspace_kind for npm_workspace_kind, both from the real workspace root)? Does TASK-8's precondition check genuinely implement the three-way branch (current==from -> write, current==target -> idempotent no-op success, else -> UnexpectedManifestVersion) rather than something subtly different? Does TASK-5/TASK-6's optional_dep_updates merge logic genuinely produce one OptionalDepUpdate per manifest path (not per platform member) as AC-007b requires?\n\nCheck all seven standard dimensions: missing criteria (any of the 16 ACs -- AC-001 through AC-013 plus AC-002b, AC-007b, AC-012b -- with no covering task), wrong order (a task referencing a symbol/field a later task creates -- e.g. does TASK-2 reference PlatformWrite.from before TASK-1 which adds it? TASK-2 depends_on TASK-1 so this should be fine, but verify), over-specified, under-specified (beyond the intentionally-abbreviated test code noted above -- are the IMPLEMENTATION steps themselves detailed enough?), poor-batching (a task crossing a compilation boundary it shouldn't -- note TASK-1 explicitly fixes the one pre-existing PlatformWrite constructor at apply.rs:2260 in the SAME task as the field addition, specifically to keep the crate compiling; verify this is sufficient or whether other constructors exist that were missed), missing-error-handling (all 3 is_error_case:true criteria -- AC-008, AC-012 -- have real implementation+test coverage, not just a mention), and orphaned-criteria. Output the standard JSON with per-issue list and overall pass/fail verdict."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1320,"cache_read_input_tokens":661915,"output_tokens":1395,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1320,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1395,"cache_read_input_tokens":661915,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1320,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1320},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce93Ejb79ciqTwdfze3d3","type":"assistant","uuid":"10e4fc97-f0b6-46e2-9b60-a4bb470254df","timestamp":"2026-08-17T21:35:19.219Z","effort":"high","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
