{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-08-17T21:52:50.561Z","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>ae2d370d83fb599ec</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>REDACTED</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2/tasks/ae2d370d83fb599ec.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Implement TASK-2 (core platform_writes producer)\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>Committed as `431feb9`.\n\n## Summary\n\nTASK-2 executed via TDD, commit `431feb9`.\n\n- **Read spec criteria** from `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/specs/SPEC-TRACK2-PLATFORM-MANIFEST-WRITES.json` directly (AC-001, AC-002, AC-005, AC-006) before writing any tests.\n- **Red phase**: wrote 3 tests in `crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/version.rs`'s `mod tests`. Ran them before implementation — the platform-write test failed with `expected exactly one PlatformWrite, got: []` (the other two passed trivially, as the plan predicted, since `Vec::new()` was already empty).\n- **Implementation**: replaced hardcoded `platform_writes: Vec::new()` with real producer logic — built `bump_by_pkg: BTreeMap&lt;PackageId, &amp;PlannedBump&gt;` from `bumps`, derived `OpenContext` exactly per `apply.rs:118-130` (cargo_workspace via `WorkspaceCargoResolver`, npm_workspace_kind via `detect_npm_workspace_kind`), then looped `ws.config.groups.fixed.values()` → `group.members(GroupMemberKind::PlatformManifest)`, matching each owner against `bump_by_pkg`, opening the manifest with `ManifestRole::Canonical` unconditionally, reading `current_version()`, and pushing `PlatformWrite { manifest, version: bump.to, from: current }`.\n- **Green**: all 3 targeted tests pass; full suite `cargo test -p callisto-graph --lib` → 367 passed, 0 failed.\n- `cargo fmt -p callisto-graph` and `cargo clippy -p callisto-graph --all-targets -- -D warnings` both clean.\n- No precision tests were supplied for this task (mutator has not yet run).\n- Did not touch `crates/callisto-graph/src/apply.rs` (out of scope, owned by concurrent TASK-7); only `commands/version.rs` was staged and committed.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"TASK-2\",\n  \"status\": \"done\",\n  \"steps_completed\": [\n    \"read AC-001/AC-002/AC-005/AC-006 from spec file on disk\",\n    \"read plan.implementation.steps for TASK-2 (bump_by_pkg BTreeMap step confirmed present)\",\n    \"wrote 3 failing tests in commands/version.rs::tests\",\n    \"ran targeted tests, confirmed red (1 failed as predicted, 2 passed trivially as predicted)\",\n    \"implemented bump_by_pkg + OpenContext derivation + PlatformManifest producer loop\",\n    \"ran targeted tests, confirmed green\",\n    \"ran full crate test suite: 367 passed, 0 failed\",\n    \"cargo fmt -p callisto-graph\",\n    \"cargo clippy -p callisto-graph --all-targets -- -D warnings: clean\",\n    \"committed\"\n  ],\n  \"test_result\": \"pass\",\n  \"commit_sha\": \"431feb9\",\n  \"concerns\": null,\n  \"criteria_evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"criterion_id\": \"AC-001\",\n      \"test_file\": \"crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/version.rs\",\n      \"test_line\": 614,\n      \"implementation_file\": \"crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/version.rs\",\n      \"implementation_line\": 296\n    },\n    {\n      \"criterion_id\": \"AC-002\",\n      \"test_file\": \"crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/version.rs\",\n      \"test_line\": 614,\n      \"implementation_file\": \"crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/version.rs\",\n      \"implementation_line\": 282\n    },\n    {\n      \"criterion_id\": \"AC-005\",\n      \"test_file\": \"crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/version.rs\",\n      \"test_line\": 690,\n      \"implementation_file\": \"crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/version.rs\",\n      \"implementation_line\": 282\n    },\n    {\n      \"criterion_id\": \"AC-006\",\n      \"test_file\": \"crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/version.rs\",\n      \"test_line\": 746,\n      \"implementation_file\": \"crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/version.rs\",\n      \"implementation_line\": 287\n    }\n  ],\n  \"reasoning\": \"TASK-2 fully implemented per plan.implementation.steps: added GroupMember/GroupMemberKind import, built bump_by_pkg from bumps Vec, derived OpenContext identically to apply.rs:118-130, looped fixed groups' PlatformManifest members matching bump_by_pkg, opened via ManifestRole::Canonical unconditionally, read current_version, pushed PlatformWrite with from+version. Fixtures used Case D hybrid-root (Cargo.toml + package.json with os/cpu arrays in same directory) per the established gotcha, confirmed against walk.rs's own case_d_single_path_multi_ecosystem_retains_bare_id_and_preserves_platform test. No spec contradictions encountered; behavior matched spec text exactly.\"\n}\n```</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>88369</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>33</tool_uses><duration_ms>341809</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
