nery will work once that separate feature ships.\n3. **reasoning** field appended with a point (9) documenting the correction rationale.\n4. **revision_note** added per the correction-mode contract, citing AC-002b, the contradiction evidence (walk.rs:199, the empirical pipeline run), the chosen option and why, and confirming AC-007 and the AC-001-derived criteria (AC-003–AC-007b) needed no change since they were always npm-scoped.\n5. `spec_file_path` left unchanged, as required in correction mode.\n\nFull corrected spec@1 JSON is shown above (read back from disk to confirm it's valid and persisted). No other criteria, api_surface entries, or the scope/purpose fields needed changes.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>66405</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>7</tool_uses><duration_ms>96649</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"},"uuid":"0ed3caf5-8ca7-4ae7-8132-06e1f693cc76","timestamp":"2026-08-17T22:02:53.045Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"task-notification"},"promptSource":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
