e::load` then pushes a `GroupMember::PlatformManifest` with `role: ManifestRole::Platform{platform:\"linux\", arch:\"x64\", abi:Some(\"gnu\")}` directly into `ws.config.groups.fixed`'s `GroupDef.members`, pointing at a fixture Cargo.toml with `version.workspace = true`, and asserts the owner receives a real `PlannedBump` and `platform_writes` resolves `from == \"3.2.1\"`.\n- AC-007's test content (two real disk-discovered platform siblings) is unchanged verbatim, per instruction.\n- `covers_criteria` unchanged: `[\"AC-002b\", \"AC-007\"]`.\n- All other tasks (TASK-1, TASK-2, TASK-4 through TASK-8) were left completely untouched.\n\n**New plan-level `spec_hash`** to apply when merging: `sha256:6a614adb29f39009483f037d398ce6db9cbd9881d5ff812ed2f2803f886620bd` (recomputed from the corrected spec file's raw bytes via `shasum -a 256`).</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>131110</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>37</tool_uses><duration_ms>445966</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"},"uuid":"9cee6356-5fb1-4ece-ae91-356a23d72e46","timestamp":"2026-08-17T22:22:21.669Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"task-notification"},"promptSource":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
