{"parentUuid":"fe93d29d-f82b-4dcf-beb4-d738d0d1dc19","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeCRkxzfFvpm6pBnozgJ1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018Wx334nUM7Pf9LDNJa1TE6","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/docs/01-spec.md","offset":8510,"limit":15},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":505,"cache_read_input_tokens":293248,"output_tokens":117,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":505,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":117,"cache_read_input_tokens":293248,"cache_creation_input_tokens":505,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":505},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCRkwpiZo7JMCzYypCXG","type":"assistant","uuid":"815d9755-0a61-440c-b844-cb3a6d052b8f","timestamp":"2026-08-19T16:32:11.712Z","effort":"high","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"815d9755-0a61-440c-b844-cb3a6d052b8f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"77a33b11-58ae-4ff8-bdb6-92604a89e081","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018Wx334nUM7Pf9LDNJa1TE6","type":"tool_result","content":"8510\t> - **The two are joined with `-`, inside a single SemVer prerelease identifier**, not with\n8511\t>   `.`. A dot would make `{sha7}` its own identifier, and a sha that happens to be all\n8512\t>   digits with a leading zero (`0123456`) is then an *invalid* numeric identifier under\n8513\t>   SemVer — a once-in-a-few-hundred-runs hard failure that would look like a callisto bug.\n8514\t>   One hyphen-joined alphanumeric identifier is always legal.\n8515\t> - **Every package gets the identical string.** A snapshot is a coordinate for one workspace\n8516\t>   state, not a per-package version line; per-package snapshot versions would make the\n8517\t>   cross-registry `optionalDependencies` pinning (§7.6 step 5) resolve against versions that\n8518\t>   do not exist yet at the moment the plan is composed.\n8519\t>\n8520\t> `SnapshotReport.version` (§M.12.5) carries this one value; `packages[]` carries the affected\n8521\t> names and ecosystems, no per-package version, for the same reason.\n8522\t\n8523\t**`matrix` (§19, §M.12.7, §CLI.6.13).** Read-only and on-demand: unlike the four functions above, it\n8524\tdoes not participate in the release cycle, consumes no changesets, and touches no `TagIndex`."}]},"uuid":"88c1024d-afe8-4f6e-b9de-90e727700d24","timestamp":"2026-08-19T16:32:11.798Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/docs/01-spec.md","content":"> - **The two are joined with `-`, inside a single SemVer prerelease identifier**, not with\n>   `.`. A dot would make `{sha7}` its own identifier, and a sha that happens to be all\n>   digits with a leading zero (`0123456`) is then an *invalid* numeric identifier under\n>   SemVer — a once-in-a-few-hundred-runs hard failure that would look like a callisto bug.\n>   One hyphen-joined alphanumeric identifier is always legal.\n> - **Every package gets the identical string.** A snapshot is a coordinate for one workspace\n>   state, not a per-package version line; per-package snapshot versions would make the\n>   cross-registry `optionalDependencies` pinning (§7.6 step 5) resolve against versions that\n>   do not exist yet at the moment the plan is composed.\n>\n> `SnapshotReport.version` (§M.12.5) carries this one value; `packages[]` carries the affected\n> names and ecosystems, no per-package version, for the same reason.\n\n**`matrix` (§19, §M.12.7, §CLI.6.13).** Read-only and on-demand: unlike the four functions above, it\ndoes not participate in the release cycle, consumes no changesets, and touches no `TagIndex`.","numLines":15,"startLine":8510,"totalLines":11434}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"815d9755-0a61-440c-b844-cb3a6d052b8f","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
