real repository. Fixed: both now explicitly name the actual seam -- constructing a Workspace over a stub CommandRunner whose tag-listing reports the tag exists while its `git rev-parse --verify --quiet <ref>^{commit}` invocation is made to fail/error, at the callisto-graph level, not via the CLI.\n\nVerify all three fixes actually hold against live code (re-check DiagnosticSeverity's real variants, re-check plan.rs:116's serde attribute, re-check whether a stub-CommandRunner-based fixture is actually constructible for create_tags_with_options given its real signature and how CommandRunner is used elsewhere in this test suite -- grep for existing stub/mock CommandRunner test patterns in crates/callisto-graph/tests/ or src/cascade.rs's test module to confirm this is a real, already-used testing pattern in this codebase, not something invented). Also do a genuinely fresh full pass over every other acceptance criterion (AC-01 through AC-13, all of them, not just the three that changed) checking for anything else missed across the three prior rounds -- this is meant to be the final, most thorough pass before human escalation would be needed.\n\nIf this passes, that's the end of Track 4's canon pipeline stage -- it moves to vector:planner next."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":808,"cache_read_input_tokens":349072,"output_tokens":1213,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":808,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1213,"cache_read_input_tokens":349072,"cache_creation_input_tokens":808,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":808},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_0