module to confirm this is a real, already-used testing pattern in this codebase, not something invented). Also do a genuinely fresh full pass over every other acceptance criterion (AC-01 through AC-13, all of them, not just the three that changed) checking for anything else missed across the three prior rounds -- this is meant to be the final, most thorough pass before human escalation would be needed.\n\nIf this passes, that's the end of Track 4's canon pipeline stage -- it moves to vector:planner next.","outputFile":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2/tasks/ae4b409ae04c45337.output","canReadOutputFile":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"512af7ef-731a-4712-98af-9b0b64a5d92b","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
