{"parentUuid":"28609aa9-3545-46b7-a46c-8735b3009df8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeCeX8rsCZjAP3UsZiyJr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DoqSacdrUEZ7HUGcF7xiYJ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto\ngit add .claude/specs/SPEC-TRACK4-RELEASE-PIPELINE-CONTRACT-CORRECTNESS.json\ngit commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\ndocs(specs): add gated spec for Track 4 release-pipeline contract correctness\n\nFour confirmed-live bugs: (1) the shipped Action script's status --check\nexit-code branching treats exit 0 as \"has changesets\" (dead code -- the\nCLI's --check contract is already correct: 1=pending, 2=none-pending,\nnever 0) while the real pending case (exit 1) falls into an error-abort\nbranch, making the release-PR-creation path unreachable on every real\nrun; (2) main.rs's doc comment describing this contract is itself stale;\n(3) callisto tag reports a fabricated sha (the requested target, not the\ntag's real existing target) when a tag already exists at a different\ncommit, in both apply and --dry-run modes; (4) plan_publish never\npopulates ReleaseEntry.changelog_section, hardcoding None despite the\nalready-implemented, already-tested extract_section function having\nzero call sites.\n\nPassed canon-exit-gate on the 5th attempt after unusually heavy\nadversarial review -- round 1 (self-audit) caught missing dry-run/\nresolve_commit-failure handling and a falsified empty-changelog-section\nedge case; round 2 caught the dry-run path bypassing the whole tag-sha\nfix entirely plus an exit-code-0 hole in the Action script; round 3\ncaught an invented \"Info\" severity tier (DiagnosticSeverity only has\nWarning/Error), a serde skip_serializing_if mismatch (null vs\nkey-absent), and an unconstructible test fixture; round 4 found the\nchangelog-path derivation ignored the already-resolved, user-overridable\nPackage.changelog field that callisto version's write side already\nuses, which would have made read/write sides disagree on which file is\n\"the\" changelog for any package using a `[[package]] changelog = \"...\"`\noverride. User consulted at the round-3/4 boundary per canon-exit-gate's\nown 3-retry escalation threshold; chose one final targeted fix over\nescalation, given both remaining blockers traced to one root cause.\n\n16 acceptance criteria (AC-01, AC-02, AC-04 through AC-13, with AC-06b/\n06c/06d covering apply-mode and dry-run-mode variants of the tag-sha\nfix's happy and failure paths).\nEOF\n)\"\ngit log --oneline -3","description":"Commit Track 4's gated spec"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":501,"cache_read_input_tokens":371222,"output_tokens":940,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":501,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":940,"cache_read_input_tokens":371222,"cache_creation_input_tokens":501,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":501},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCeX7JrDo8x9ofhneoFR","type":"assistant","uuid":"0d08bc27-7cf0-4be5-b8e7-7791376d62f7","timestamp":"2026-08-19T19:19:40.898Z","effort":"high","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
