{"parentUuid":"d55cf8c5-42db-4bbd-afeb-0a1bac29d165","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeCjEgHqFBbQFuwWkHPDp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No — there's meaningful work left. Here's the honest breakdown against the 12-track master plan:\n\n**Fully done:**\n- Track 3b-e (identity/ecosystem resolution hardening) + Track 3a (match semantics doc fix)\n- Track 1 (fixed-group cascade correctness)\n- Track 2 (platform-manifest/optionalDependencies writes)\n- Track 9 (cascade peer-escalation + cross-ecosystem rewrite-keys)\n- Track 6-doc/8-doc (stale spec claims) + SnapshotReport/InitReport doc corrections\n\n**In progress:**\n- Track 4 (release-pipeline/Action contract correctness) — spec and plan both gated and passed, implementation underway: T1 done, T2 just landed, 8 of 10 tasks remain\n\n**Not started:**\n- Track 6-mechanical — the JSON report field-shape fixes (`ValidateReport`'s `ok` rename, `ComposePrBodyReport`'s `body` rename + missing `metadata`, `TagReport`'s `tags` rename + missing `already_existed`, `StatusReport`'s missing fields). Only the piece that overlapped with Track 4 (the `sha` value fix) is done — the renames and the `already_existed` field addition are still open.\n- Track 5 (changelog/PR-body rendering consolidation) — was gated on Track 1(b), which is now shipped, so it's unblocked but not yet spec'd\n- Track 7 (perf: git revwalk bounding, redundant I/O)\n- Track 8-mechanical (config error variants + Python workspace-root detection)\n- Track 11/12 (diagnostic/error-contract polish, stale doc citations)\n\n**Deliberately deferred, not scheduled:**\n- Track 8-feature (`moon.yml extensions.callisto`) — still blocked on an unresolved product decision\n- Track 10 (test/fixture infrastructure buildout) — explicit backlog\n\nI'll finish Track 4 first, then move to Track 6-mechanical or Track 5 next unless you want to redirect."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"st