{"parentUuid":"1a84b77a-d508-4807-998b-f136e2c46fbb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeCmPAzCUPXZT4J5Y9Ty1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":757,"cache_read_input_tokens":475466,"output_tokens":1100,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":87},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":757,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1100,"cache_read_input_tokens":475466,"cache_creation_input_tokens":757,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":757},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCmP8wurRqQgt1VZFJ5w","type":"assistant","uuid":"0fa62e51-7476-4ab7-b370-977c7d48f81a","timestamp":"2026-08-19T20:49:32.647Z","effort":"high","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"0fa62e51-7476-4ab7-b370-977c7d48f81a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeCmPAzCUPXZT4J5Y9Ty1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's everything remaining, organized by what's actually confirmed-broken vs. quality/completeness work:\n\n**Track 4 — Release-pipeline correctness (in progress, 3/10 tasks done)**\nReal, confirmed bugs in the CLI↔GitHub Action contract:\n- ✅ T1: Action script's exit-code branching (was making release-PR creation unreachable on every real run)\n- ✅ T2: stale doc comment matching\n- ✅ T3: tag command fabricates a sha when a tag already exists at a different commit (apply mode)\n- ⬜ T4: same tag-sha fix, `--dry-run` mode\n- ⬜ T5: regression proof for T3/T4\n- ⬜ T6: new diagnostic code for changelog read failures\n- ⬜ T7: `plan_publish` never populates `changelog_section` — always `None`\n- ⬜ T8-T9: regression proofs for T7\n- ⬜ T10: schema guard (confirms no report shape drifted)\n\n**Track 6-mechanical — JSON report field-shape fixes (not started)**\n`ValidateReport.ok` rename, `ComposePrBodyReport.body` rename + missing `metadata` object, `TagReport.tags` rename + missing `already_existed` field (shares a fix site with Track 4's T3/T4), `StatusReport` missing fields. These are breaking renames for anyone parsing today's JSON — real, but nothing is currently consuming this JSON externally (confirmed earlier: no registry publish has ever happened).\n\n**Track 5 — Changelog/PR-body rendering consolidation (not started, now unblocked)**\n`pr_body.rs` hand-rolls Markdown instead of using the shared renderer; two `ChangeSource` variants are never constructed in production; multi-cause bumps silently drop all but one changelog entry.\n\n**Track 7 — Performance (not started)**\nGit revwalk does 2 full unbounded walks per package regardless of tag proximity (~2s vs ~13ms measured), plus a correctness bug riding along (wrong `changedSinceLastTag` for unrelated-file commits). `TagIndex::build` recompiles a glob matcher per package.\n\n**Track 8-mechanical — Small gaps (not started)**\nTwo declared-but-never-constructed `ConfigError` variants; missing Python marker in workspace-root detection.\n\n**Track 11/12 — Polish (not started)**\nMissing `#[diagnostic]` attrs, inconsistent error-code coverage, stale doc citations.\n\n**Deliberately deferred, not release-relevant either way:** Track 8-feature (`moon.yml` integration, blocked on a product decision) and Track 10 (test fixture infrastructure).\n\nMy read: Track 4 is the only track where \"ship as-is\" means shipping something that's *actively wrong* in the release path itself (a tag command that lies about what commit it tagged, a changelog excerpt that's silently always empty). Everything else is real but not release-blocking in that sense."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":757,"cache_read_input_tokens":475466,"output_tokens":1100,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":87},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":757,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1100,"cache_read_input_tokens":475466,"cache_creation_input_tokens":757,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":757},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCmP8wurRqQgt1VZFJ5w","type":"assistant","uuid":"20ecc6f8-832d-4be0-8d84-61527e697820","timestamp":"2026-08-19T20:49:43.726Z","effort":"high","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
