{"parentUuid":"25b7ec7d-6b11-4cd3-93c5-ddf3deae57d7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeCuSa6X9b4Gz8uGGEZSp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019J6WmZmBhtA7XvJyaV8pkm","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Implement Track 4 T7","subagent_type":"lambda:implementer","prompt":"Workspace root: /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto (Rust cargo workspace, moon-managed). Execute exactly task T7 from the plan at .claude/plans/PLAN-TRACK4-RELEASE-PIPELINE-CONTRACT-CORRECTNESS.json — read the plan from disk and pull T7's exact steps from there (test content, implementation old_string/new_string and implementation_2). T1-T6 are already committed (2e6f25c5, 442ceeb6, 5166d601, 3bcc91e2, 5e02f0c9, fa038214) — DiagnosticCode::ChangelogReadError now exists.\n\nWorkspace manifest (baseline green after T6, spec hash matches): { \"workspace_root\": \"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto\", \"language\": \"rust\", \"test_runner\": \"cargo test\", \"build_tool\": \"cargo\", \"spec_file_path\": \".claude/specs/SPEC-TRACK4-RELEASE-PIPELINE-CONTRACT-CORRECTNESS.json\" }\n\nT7 in one sentence: replace the hardcoded `changelog_section: None` in crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/publish.rs's plan_publish (around line 427, may have shifted slightly) with a new `resolve_changelog_section` helper function that reads the package's already-resolved `pkg.changelog: Option<PathBuf>` path (always Some by construction, per walk.rs), calls `callisto_changelog::extract_section`, and reports the two non-fatal outcomes this task covers (AC-10: found with content; AC-11: file doesn't exist) via a Warning-severity `DiagnosticCode::ChangelogSectionNotFound` diagnostic — the helper also has match arms for the empty-section and unreadable-file cases (AC-10b/AC-12/AC-12c) that T8/T9 will separately test as pure regressions, since they're implemented in this same helper.\n\nThis is the plan's most substantial remaining task — verify EVERY symb