{"parentUuid":"ef454f9f-8c0e-45aa-afb6-19ae279da7dc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeEN6ar1Cyg3Y8gQzMCFY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TDYYYLrDQZug7BdtPhtkwt","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto\ngit add crates/callisto-cli/src/commands/status.rs crates/callisto-cli/src/render/mod.rs crates/callisto-cli/tests/schema_guard_test.rs crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/status.rs crates/callisto-model/src/ecosystem.rs crates/callisto-model/src/report.rs\ngit commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nfix(model): correct StatusReport/StatusPackageRecord field shape to match docs\n\nTrack 6-mechanical: StatusReport was missing the documented mandatory\nhasChangesets field (which the Action's mode dispatch reads);\nStatusPackageRecord was missing lastReleasedVersion and releaseTrigger,\nand had skip_serializing_if on changedSinceLastTag despite the doc\nrequiring it always be present. All three are now populated from real\ndata already computed in callisto-graph's status command (last tag's\nversion, the package's configured release trigger, and whether any\npackage has pending changesets) rather than added as inert placeholders.\n\nReleaseTrigger gained a JsonSchema derive, required once it's reachable\nfrom a JsonSchema-deriving struct. Track 4's AC-13 schema guard baseline\nupdated to reflect this intentional shape change -- its whole purpose is\ndetecting drift, and it correctly caught this one.\n\nNo SCHEMA_VERSION bump: this project has never completed a real\nregistry publish, so there is no external consumer of this wire format\nto protect from a shape change yet.\nEOF\n)\"\ngit log --oneline -3","description":"Commit StatusReport fix"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":495,"cache_read_input_tokens":612027,"output_tokens":628,"output_tokens_details