{"parentUuid":"4a27c466-246c-49a0-ada0-f46d6fcbe310","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeEShcJ1Y5ddTA9DbyrVb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01M7PeiW8SdDuxws4u177m9w","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Fix TagReport/CreatedTag field mismatches","subagent_type":"lambda:implementer","prompt":"Workspace root: /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto (Rust cargo workspace, moon-managed). This is a Track 6-mechanical fix — lighter TDD loop tier (no formal spec/plan, this task IS the full scope). Do the work directly: red test → minimal fix → green → full suite → fmt → clippy → commit. This is the LAST report-type fix in Track 6-mechanical.\n\nContext: an earlier research pass found TagReport/CreatedTag (crates/callisto-model/src/report.rs) has field-shape mismatches against the documented wire contract in docs/01-spec.md §M.12.6 (search for \"TagReport\", \"CreatedTag\"). Reported findings (RE-VERIFY every one against live code and the live doc before acting):\n1. The doc documents TagReport's array field as `tags: Vec<CreatedTag>`; the current struct has `created_tags: Vec<CreatedTag>` instead — a JSON key rename (`tags`, not `createdTags`).\n2. The doc documents `CreatedTag` with an `already_existed: bool` field (doc comment: roughly \"`true` when the tag already existed at this sha and was left alone... An existing tag at a *different* sha is an error diagnostic, not a silent overwrite\" — read the doc's exact wording), which is entirely missing from the current struct.\n\nCRITICAL — read this before touching anything: crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/tag.rs was substantially rewritten in Track 4 of this same session (commits 5166d601 and 3bcc91e2, already shipped) to fix a \"fabricated sha\" bug. Both the apply path and the dry-run path in `create_tags_with_options` ALREADY compute a local variable `let already_existed = ws.tags()?.contains_tag(tag_str);` for exactly this purpose (deciding whether to call resolve_commit vs create_tag) -- this data already exists at every CreatedTag construction site, it just isn't threaded into the CreatedTag struct literal yet. Track 4's own AC-13 guard test (crates/callisto-cli/tests/schema_guard_test.rs) explicitly asserted CreatedTag's shape stays unchanged -- that assertion was correct for Track 4's own scope (it only changed field VALUES, not shape) but this task is explicitly the one that changes the shape, so that guard test's CreatedTag baseline needs updating too. Read crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/tag.rs in full before making any change, and find every CreatedTag construction site (there are multiple: the per-release tag in both apply/dry-run branches, and the floating-major alias tag in both branches -- the floating-major alias should also get an already_existed value, likely computed the same way via ws.tags()?.contains_tag() on the alias's own tag name, verify this against the doc's intent).\n\nIMPORTANT constraint: NO SCHEMA_VERSION bump (no external registry consumer yet, resolved earlier this session).\n\nProcess: 1) Read docs/01-spec.md's actual current TagReport/CreatedTag documentation in full. 2) Read tag.rs in full (post-Track-4) to understand exactly where already_existed is already computed for each of the (up to 4) CreatedTag construction sites. 3) Read report.rs's current TagReport/CreatedTag structs. 4) Write failing tests first (both for the tags/createdTags rename and for already_existed being populated correctly per the doc's semantics), confirm red, then implement, confirm green. 5) Update crates/callisto-cli/tests/schema_guard_test.rs's CreatedTag baseline (required/properties sets) to include already_existed and confirm that guard test passes again with the new, intentional shape.\n\nBefore committing: run the full `cargo test -p callisto-model`, `cargo test -p callisto-graph`, `cargo test -p callisto-cli`, and `cargo test -p callisto-moon` suites, `cargo fmt --check` on each touched crate, and `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings` on each touched crate. Commit with a clear conventional commit message when everything is clean and verified. This closes out Track 6-mechanical's report-field-shape work entirely -- say so explicitly in your final report if all four report types (StatusReport, ValidateReport, ComposePrBodyReport already done this session, now TagReport/CreatedTag) are confirmed done."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":213,"cache_read_input_tokens":626500,"output_tokens":1904,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":258},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":213,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1904,"cache_read_input_tokens":626500,"cache_creation_input_tokens":213,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":213},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeEShYa2FgF4eu8Wr8Cn7","type":"assistant","uuid":"6ba333ca-91a1-4f91-84c1-42296ae99ee3","timestamp":"2026-08-20T18:06:01.622Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.236","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
