{"parentUuid":"062beae5-0869-4cef-a0ee-5ab7b040ead4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeEVyHTUf4QV8qkSnmG2Y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Confirmed both findings are still live. Track 5 has three real components, and the scale differs a lot depending on how much you take on:\n\n1. **`pr_body.rs` hand-rolls Markdown instead of calling `callisto_changelog::render_section`** — a real consolidation, moderate risk (touches PR-body output format).\n2. **`ChangeSource::Commit`/`ChangeSource::NewGroupMember` are matched but never constructed** — meaning inference-driven bumps and fixed-group new-member joins never actually produce a changelog entry citing their real cause today. This is a genuine gap, not just a code-tidiness issue.\n3. **`ChangelogInput.entries` silently drops all but one cause when a package has multiple contributing changes in one run** (changeset + cascade + peer-escalation) — a real data-loss bug in changelog accuracy.\n\nGiven how Track 4 and Track 9 both went (multiple rounds of adversarial review each), a full canon pipeline for this — as the master plan originally tiered it — is a real time commitment, not a quick pass like the Track 6 fixes."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":634,"cache_read_input_tokens":662186,"output_tokens":1200,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":362},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":634,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1200,"cache_read_input_tokens":662186,"cache_creation_input_tokens":634,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":634},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeEVyC5mXpUJvEJu5DjcV","type":"assistant","uuid":"701411dc-e919-4e20-824e-c2e5e7c17fad","timestamp":"2026-08-20T18:48:45.885Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.236","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"701411dc-e919-4e20-824e-c2e5e7c17fad","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeEVyHTUf4QV8qkSnmG2Y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0154asq9uTDx8Zbsxo5ti7cm","name":"AskUserQuestion","input":{"questions":[{"question":"How do you want to handle Track 5 given the release timeline?","header":"Track 5 scope","options":[{"label":"Full canon pipeline, same rigor as Track 4/9","description":"Draft spec → exit-gate → plan → challenger → implement, matching this session's established rigor for architectural changes. Most thorough, but likely another multi-round, multi-hour effort based on Track 4/9's precedent."},{"label":"Lighter loop, narrower scope (Recommended)","description":"Treat as 2-3 targeted correctness fixes (like Track 6) rather than a full architectural consolidation: wire pr_body.rs to render_section, construct the two missing ChangeSource variants at their real call sites, fix the entries-union bug. Skip the formal canon/vector ceremony given time pressure."},{"label":"Defer Track 5 entirely, release with just Track 4 + 6","description":"Ship now. Track 5's bugs are real but none of them break the release pipeline itself (unlike Track 4) or change wire contracts (unlike Track 6) — they affect changelog/PR-body content quality. Note it as next-cycle backlog."}]}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":634,"cache_read_input_tokens":662186,"output_tokens":1200,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":362},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":634,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1200,"cache_read_input_tokens":662186,"cache_creation_input_tokens":634,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_in