n present; the `else` branch (lines 156-195, which synthesizes `ChangeSource` from `outcome.reasons.get(id)`) never runs when a changeset entry exists. So changeset-vs-synthesized is a hard if/else, not a union — this matches \"changeset always wins over other sources\" exactly.\n\nDeeper root cause: `outcome.reasons`/`agg.reasons` are `BTreeMap&lt;PackageId, BumpReason&gt;` — single-valued per package by construction, all the way up through `cascade.rs`'s severity/reason bookkeeping. So even within the non-changeset branch, only one synthesized entry is ever possible per package regardless of how many real causes contributed.\n\n**Scoped fix is achievable without deep architecture change**: `outcome.reasons.get(id)` is still readable inside the changeset branch (it's a separate map from `agg.changelog_inputs`), so the union fix can be: when a changeset drove the bump AND `outcome.reasons.get(id)` also holds a genuine non-changeset reason (cascade/peer-escalation/group-union), append a second synthesized `ChangelogEntry` to `agg_input.entries` alongside the changeset one. This closes the most common real-world case (changeset + cascade colliding) without touching the single-valued `reasons` maps upstream. A *full* multi-cause union (e.g. two cascades from different paths) would need `reasons` to become `Vec&lt;BumpReason&gt;` throughout cascade.rs — out of reach for a scoped fix, should be flagged as a known remaining limitation if the spec doesn't take it on.\n\n**Summary for spec-scoping, mirroring the ComposePrBodyReport precedent:** unlike that case, all three \"missing\" pieces here (#2, #3, and the common-case union in #4) have real backing data sitting one hop away from where they're discarded — none require fabricating placeholder data. #1 is real integration work reusing existing mapping logic. The spec can require full implementation of all four rather than deferring any of them, though #4 should scope explicitly to \"changeset + one other reason\" and name the deeper multi-cascade-union case as an explicit non-goal.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>684301</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>10</tool_uses><duration_ms>86847</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"},"uuid":"a243ec8f-6f83-45ff-b2c6-5e917c20b366","timestamp":"2026-08-20T19:03:47.745Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"task-notification"},"promptSource":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.236","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
