ngeSource, Aggregation, CascadeOutcome, GroupCheckOutcome, InferenceOutcome, VersionPlan, PlannedBump, ChangelogWrite, GroupName, SeverityInference trait). (2) Traced cascade.rs's fixed-group convergence block (lines ~416-442) and groups.rs's fixed_group_target: aligned_base is computed from the released member's base version, and when both group members share an identical base version, the independently-computed member target equals the group-wide winner, so the overwrite condition `out.targets.get(&amp;id) != Some(&amp;winner)` is false for the fresh member and its reason survives -- confirms T4/T5's fixture claims and entries.len()/ChangeSource-sequence assertions hold. (3) Confirmed group_check/outcome/agg/sev/id/to/from are all live identifiers in scope at version.rs's insertion point via direct read of the real function body -- no wrong-scope compile risk. (4) T7's dispatch and T8's fallback restructuring compose unambiguously: T8 explicitly quotes and replaces T7's exact inner block, leaving a single deterministic final code shape. Only issue found is a minor TDD-process risk on T1 (immediately-green test conflicting with lambda:implementer's red-phase heuristic), which is non-blocking since it's explainable from the task's own reasoning field and does not affect correctness of the resulting code.\"\n}\n```\n\nGiven this is presumably a first review pass and the single issue found is advisory (not a missing/wrong-order/missing-error-handling/orphaned-criteria defect), overall verdict is **pass**. Relevant files: `/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/08ccaac1-3846-4134-8b06-140e5b9c22f2/scratchpad/plan-track5-draft.json`, `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/specs/SPEC-TRACK5-CHANGELOG-PR-BODY-CONSOLIDATION.json`.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>110395</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>25</tool_uses><duration_ms>210650</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"},"uuid":"1ce0301c-dbc0-4d0e-9e43-cde3a91a2bea","timestamp":"2026-08-20T21:34:07.279Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"task-notification"},"promptSource":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.236","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
