{"parentUuid":"d1c2ee15-f775-4712-949c-40bc40092064","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeFE4Q8ME5D1akx5P6zmN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012gGfewhLT1UU2AmCHKZ6bS","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/README.md","offset":215,"limit":25},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":379,"cache_read_input_tokens":323337,"output_tokens":110,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":379,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":110,"cache_read_input_tokens":323337,"cache_creation_input_tokens":379,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":379},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeFE4NbaKg2D6xhck1aaR","type":"assistant","uuid":"38495ae3-a37a-489b-a816-8a7cede428b9","timestamp":"2026-08-21T04:00:33.154Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"38495ae3-a37a-489b-a816-8a7cede428b9","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"6171ccd7-1299-42dd-a191-aa10849f9cb1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012gGfewhLT1UU2AmCHKZ6bS","type":"tool_result","content":"215\t```\n216\t\n217\t---\n218\t\n219\t## Workspace Crate Architecture\n220\t\n221\tCallisto is structured into 10 workspace crates divided across permissive (`MIT OR Apache-2.0`) and copyleft (`AGPL-3.0-only`) licenses:\n222\t\n223\t| Layer | Crate | License | Purpose |\n224\t| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n225\t| **Layer 1** | [`callisto-model`](crates/callisto-model) | MIT/Apache-2.0 | Domain primitives, version grammars, JSON report contracts |\n226\t| | [`callisto-format`](crates/callisto-format) | MIT/Apache-2.0 | Changeset `.md` and `pre.json` parsers and writers |\n227\t| | [`callisto-conventional`](crates/callisto-conventional) | AGPL-3.0 | Conventional commit parsing and bump severity classification |\n228\t| | [`callisto-changelog`](crates/callisto-changelog) | AGPL-3.0 | Markdown changelog renderer |\n229\t| **Layer 2** | [`callisto-manifests`](crates/callisto-manifests) | AGPL-3.0 | Format-preserving manifest AST editors and atomic file writes |\n230\t| | [`callisto-vcs`](crates/callisto-vcs) | AGPL-3.0 | Native in-process Git operations powered by `gix` (gitoxide) |\n231\t| **Layer 3** | [`callisto-graph`](crates/callisto-graph) | AGPL-3.0 | Dependency DAG solver and Tarjan SCC cycle diagnostics |\n232\t| **Layer 4** | [`callisto-cli`](crates/callisto-cli) | AGPL-3.0 | Standalone CLI binary, colored diff previews, `miette` diagnostic cards |\n233\t| | [`callisto-moon`](crates/callisto-moon) | AGPL-3.0 | Moon extension protocol implementation (`extism-pdk`) |\n234\t| **Dev** | [`callisto-fixtures`](crates/callisto-fixtures) | AGPL-3.0 | Multi-ecosystem corpus and in-memory test doubles |\n235\t\n236\t---\n237\t\n238\t## Development & Task Runners\n239\t"}]},"uuid":"fd9f26e7-e70c-4ccd-9b3d-b108ac943cad","timestamp":"2026-08-21T04:00:33.207Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/README.md","content":"```\n\n---\n\n## Workspace Crate Architecture\n\nCallisto is structured into 10 workspace crates divided across permissive (`MIT OR Apache-2.0`) and copyleft (`AGPL-3.0-only`) licenses:\n\n| Layer | Crate | License | Purpose |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Layer 1** | [`callisto-model`](crates/callisto-model) | MIT/Apache-2.0 | Domain primitives, version grammars, JSON report contracts |\n| | [`callisto-format`](crates/callisto-format) | MIT/Apache-2.0 | Changeset `.md` and `pre.json` parsers and writers |\n| | [`callisto-conventional`](crates/callisto-conventional) | AGPL-3.0 | Conventional commit parsing and bump severity classification |\n| | [`callisto-changelog`](crates/callisto-changelog) | AGPL-3.0 | Markdown changelog renderer |\n| **Layer 2** | [`callisto-manifests`](crates/callisto-manifests) | AGPL-3.0 | Format-preserving manifest AST editors and atomic file writes |\n| | [`callisto-vcs`](crates/callisto-vcs) | AGPL-3.0 | Native in-process Git operations powered by `gix` (gitoxide) |\n| **Layer 3** | [`callisto-graph`](crates/callisto-graph) | AGPL-3.0 | Dependency DAG solver and Tarjan SCC cycle diagnostics |\n| **Layer 4** | [`callisto-cli`](crates/callisto-cli) | AGPL-3.0 | Standalone CLI binary, colored diff previews, `miette` diagnostic cards |\n| | [`callisto-moon`](crates/callisto-moon) | AGPL-3.0 | Moon extension protocol implementation (`extism-pdk`) |\n| **Dev** | [`callisto-fixtures`](crates/callisto-fixtures) | AGPL-3.0 | Multi-ecosystem corpus and in-memory test doubles |\n\n---\n\n## Development & Task Runners\n","numLines":25,"startLine":215,"totalLines":261}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"38495ae3-a37a-489b-a816-8a7cede428b9","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d