{"parentUuid":"719595e6-7194-475e-b152-8177a47a4206","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeFE4raKhELUEpTnqC4C3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QJzaH2wJBk5H8HmjsnuYWd","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/README.md","offset":1,"limit":60},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":557,"cache_read_input_tokens":324709,"output_tokens":269,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":138},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":557,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":269,"cache_read_input_tokens":324709,"cache_creation_input_tokens":557,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":557},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeFE4qHS6SQQVikdHL47f","type":"assistant","uuid":"fcb93784-7380-40d9-947f-084a613b2e17","timestamp":"2026-08-21T04:00:40.697Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"fcb93784-7380-40d9-947f-084a613b2e17","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"6171ccd7-1299-42dd-a191-aa10849f9cb1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QJzaH2wJBk5H8HmjsnuYWd","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t<p align=\"center\">\n2\t  <img src=\"assets/callisto-logo.png\" width=\"180\" alt=\"Callisto Release Engine Logo\" />\n3\t</p>\n4\t\n5\t<p align=\"center\">\n6\t  <b>The fast, crash-safe, polyglot monorepo release engine.</b><br />\n7\t  <i>Replaces Node.js runtimes, fragile regular expression edits, and duplicate CI matrix YAML with a single native Rust binary.</i>\n8\t</p>\n9\t\n10\t<p align=\"center\">\n11\t  <a href=\"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/actions/workflows/callisto-ci.yml\"><img src=\"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/actions/workflows/callisto-ci.yml/badge.svg\" alt=\"CI\" /></a>\n12\t  <a href=\"LICENSE\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT%20OR%20Apache--2.0-blue.svg\" alt=\"License\" /></a>\n13\t  <a href=\"crates/callisto-model\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/unsafe_code-forbid-success.svg\" alt=\"Safety\" /></a>\n14\t</p>\n15\t\n16\t---\n17\t\n18\t## Key Capabilities\n19\t\n20\t> **Sub-10ms Native Speed**  \n21\t> Native Rust binary executes workspace discovery and version planning in under 10ms — 30x to 50x faster than `@changesets/cli` or `release-please`.\n22\t\n23\t> **Concrete Syntax Tree (CST) Format Preservation**  \n24\t> Edits `Cargo.toml` and `package.json` using `toml_edit` and `serde_json` indentation fingerprinting, preserving user comments, table ordering, and whitespace.\n25\t\n26\t> **Crash-Safe Atomic Disk Writes**  \n27\t> Writes updates to `NamedTempFile` temporary buffers before atomic POSIX `fs::rename` swaps, preventing corrupt or partial manifest writes during process interruption.\n28\t\n29\t> **Topological Directed Graph Solver**  \n30\t> Models workspace package dependencies using `petgraph`'s Kahn topological solver and Tarjan's SCC algorithm to compute cascading version bumps and catch circular dependency cycles.\n31\t\n32\t> **Zero-Config Native Matrix Auto-Discovery**  \n33\t> `callisto matrix` auto-discovers napi-rs and maturin build targets (`napi.targets`, `[tool.maturin].targets`) plus npm/PyPI runtime constraints (`engines.node`, `requires-python`) straight from manifests — no duplicate CI YAML to keep in sync.  \n34\t> Java (`java.version`) and .NET native-AOT discovery are planned for a future release.\n35\t\n36\t> **Hermetic & Build-System Agnostic**  \n37\t> Pure Rust CLI engine runs seamlessly in Bazel sandboxes (`rules_callisto`), Buck2, Nix flakes, Moon WASM (`callisto-moon`), GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, and local VCS hooks (`just hooks`).\n38\t\n39\t---\n40\t\n41\t## Quick Start (4 Steps)\n42\t\n43\t```text\n44\t$ callisto status\n45\tStatus (schema v1):\n46\t  callisto-cli        0.1.0  ->  0.2.0  (minor)  [.changeset/swift-foxes-leap.md]\n47\t  callisto-graph      0.1.0  ->  0.1.1  (patch)  [cascade: callisto-cli]\n48\t\n49\t$ callisto version\n50\t  + Updated 2 package manifests (CST preserved)\n51\t  + Appended changelog entries to CHANGELOG.md\n52\t  + Consumed 1 changeset (.changeset/swift-foxes-leap.md)\n53\t```\n54\t\n55\t### Step 1: Initialize Callisto in Your Workspace\n56\t\n57\tRun `init` in your repository root to create `callisto.toml` and `.changeset/`:\n58\t\n59\t```bash\n60\tcallisto init --yes"}]},"uuid":"865fd965-a008-42c2-9a65-0ee54f4db3e1","timestamp":"2026-08-21T04:00:40.752Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/README.md","content":"<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"assets/callisto-logo.png\" width=\"180\" alt=\"Callisto Release Engine Logo\" />\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <b>The fast, crash-safe, polyglot monorepo release engine.</b><br />\n  <i>Replaces Node.js runtimes, fragile regular expression edits, and duplicate CI matrix YAML with a single native Rust binary.</i>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/actions/workflows/callisto-ci.yml\"><img src=\"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/actions/workflows/callisto-ci.yml/badge.svg\" alt=\"CI\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"LICENSE\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT%20OR%20Apache--2.0-blue.svg\" alt=\"License\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"crates/callisto-model\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/unsafe_code-forbid-success.svg\" alt=\"Safety\" /></a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\n## Key Capabilities\n\n> **Sub-10ms Native Speed**  \n> Native Rust binary executes workspace discovery and version planning in under 10ms — 30x to 50x faster than `@changesets/cli` or `release-please`.\n\n> **Concrete Syntax Tree (CST) Format Preservation**  \n> Edits `Cargo.toml` and `package.json` using `toml_edit` and `serde_json` indentation fingerprinting, preserving user comments, table ordering, and whitespace.\n\n> **Crash-Safe Atomic Disk Writes**  \n> Writes updates to `NamedTempFile` temporary buffers before atomic POSIX `fs::rename` swaps, preventing corrupt or partial manifest writes during process interruption.\n\n> **Topological Directed Graph Solver**  \n> Models workspace package dependencies using `petgraph`'s Kahn topological solver and Tarjan's SCC algorithm to compute cascading version bumps and catch circular dependency cycles.\n\n> **Zero-Config Native Matrix Auto-Discovery**  \n> `callisto matrix` auto-discovers napi-rs and maturin build targets (`napi.targets`, `[tool.maturin].targets`) plus npm/PyPI runtime constraints (`engines.node`, `requires-python`) straight from manifests — no duplicate CI YAML to keep in sync.  \n> Java (`java.version`) and .NET native-AOT discovery are planned for a future release.\n\n> **Hermetic & Build-System Agnostic**  \n> Pure Rust CLI engine runs seamlessly in Bazel sandboxes (`rules_callisto`), Buck2, Nix flakes, Moon WASM (`callisto-moon`), GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, and local VCS hooks (`just hooks`).\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start (4 Steps)\n\n```text\n$ callisto status\nStatus (schema v1):\n  callisto-cli        0.1.0  ->  0.2.0  (minor)  [.changeset/swift-foxes-leap.md]\n  callisto-graph      0.1.0  ->  0.1.1  (patch)  [cascade: callisto-cli]\n\n$ callisto version\n  + Updated 2 package manifests (CST preserved)\n  + Appended changelog entries to CHANGELOG.md\n  + Consumed 1 changeset (.changeset/swift-foxes-leap.md)\n```\n\n### Step 1: Initialize Callisto in Your Workspace\n\nRun `init` in your repository root to create `callisto.toml` and `.changeset/`:\n\n```bash\ncallisto init --yes","numLines":60,"startLine":1,"totalLines":261}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"fcb93784-7380-40d9-947f-084a613b2e17","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
