{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","prNumber":5,"prUrl":"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/pull/5","prRepository":"orin-dx/callisto","timestamp":"2026-08-21T04:41:48.743Z"}
{"parentUuid":"4023c503-03d6-4d84-bcff-91825f3e1123","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeFHBwAwMcDz7WHRRgtS1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EJonaJwjcjxbiH9xK7KpbX","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"gh pr create --title \"Release pipeline correctness, callisto matrix, and cross-ecosystem identity fixes\" --body \"$(cat <<'EOF'\n## Summary\n\nThis bundles a large batch of work accumulated since the last release (`v0.3.3`, 243 commits) into one PR:\n\n- **New `callisto matrix` command** — napi/maturin platform target discovery, CI table generation, runtime version reporting.\n- **Fixed-group cascade correctness** — group siblings now converge on a shared target instead of drifting independently; peer-escalation and cross-ecosystem rewrite key fixes.\n- **Release pipeline contract fixes** — `callisto tag` no longer fabricates shas, the shipped GitHub Action's exit-code branching now matches the CLI's real contract, `plan_publish` reads back real changelog sections.\n- **JSON report shape corrections** — several report field renames/additions to match the documented wire contract (breaking; see changeset).\n- **Changelog/PR-body rendering consolidation** — one render path shared between CHANGELOG.md and PR bodies; previously-dropped bump reasons (inference, new group members) now render correctly.\n- **Cross-ecosystem/workspace-membership identity hardening** — correct package discovery across Cargo/npm/pnpm workspaces and dual-ecosystem (Rust+Python) packages.\n- **Security hardening** — argument-injection, SSRF, credential-redaction, and DoS-bound fixes across the publish/tag/subprocess paths.\n- Numerous smaller correctness and performance fixes (see changeset for the full list).\n\nFull details, per-package severity, and migration notes for every breaking change are in `.changeset/release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening.md`.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `cargo fmt --check` clean across all 10 crates\n- [x] `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings` clean across all 10 crates (verified per-crate throughout implementation, and again via the pre-push lint hook on this branch)\n- [x] Per-crate test suites green throughout implementation (workspace-wide `cargo nextest run` was not completed locally — it stalled after ~40 minutes with negligible CPU usage, consistent with a known environment issue; per-crate verification was used instead)\n- [ ] CI on this PR (has not run yet — this is the first push to origin since `v0.3.3`)\n- [x] Changeset added covering all touched packages with justified severity levels\nEOF\n)\""},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":503,"cache_read_input_tokens":346177,"output_tokens":887,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":503,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":887,"cache_read_input_tokens":346177,"cache_creation_input_tokens":503,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":503},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeFHBunMB62yi62xEQPta","type":"assistant","uuid":"46b593c8-3a59-4f24-8f2f-2491a6792b4a","timestamp":"2026-08-21T04:41:44.546Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
