{"parentUuid":"8c82ca21-5877-4cf9-b0d7-781e06976d27","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"dbf56e01-f96e-4335-bb6b-59b82257a3f1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LkcVqL3U83yRv6PVUpiFHR","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/deny.toml has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"b30ee2b1-128b-4f5e-ae8f-317212a428ae","timestamp":"2026-08-21T04:48:07.864Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/deny.toml","oldString":"    \"RUSTSEC-2024-0370\", # proc-macro-error: unmaintained (transitive via moon_config)\n]","newString":"    \"RUSTSEC-2024-0370\", # proc-macro-error: unmaintained (transitive via moon_config)\n    \"RUSTSEC-2026-0250\", # im-rc: unmaintained (transitive via wasm-compose -> wasmtime)\n    \"RUSTSEC-2026-0251\", # sized-chunks: unmaintained (transitive via im-rc -> wasm-compose -> wasmtime)\n]","originalFile":"# cargo-deny configuration for Callisto monorepo\n[graph]\ntargets = []\n\n[licenses]\nallow = [\"MIT\", \"Apache-2.0\", \"AGPL-3.0-only\", \"Zlib\", \"Unicode-3.0\", \"Unicode-DFS-2016\", \"BSL-1.0\", \"BSD-3-Clause\", \"ISC\", \"MPL-2.0\", \"BSD-2-Clause\"]\nconfidence-threshold = 0.8\nunused-allowed-license = \"allow\"\n\n[bans]\nmultiple-versions = \"warn\"\nwildcards = \"allow\"\nhighlight = \"all\"\n\n# All 11 advisories below are pulled in transitively and ONLY as dev-dependencies\n# of crates/callisto-moon, via moon_pdk_test_utils -> warpgate (host-side plugin\n# loader) / moon_config -> wasmtime and proc-macro-error respectively. They are\n# used exclusively by callisto-moon's integration tests to load and execute our\n# own compiled .wasm under a real Extism/wasmtime host inside `cargo test` --\n# none of this ships in the actual plugin artifact (that only depends on the\n# separate, lightweight warpgate_pdk guest-side crate, which pulls in neither\n# wasmtime nor proc-macro-error and is unaffected). Revisit and narrow/remove\n# these ignores once moon_pdk_test_utils/warpgate/moon_config bump their\n# wasmtime and proc-macro-error pins past the fixed/maintained versions.\n#\n# NOTE: this list was observed to be UNSTABLE across consecutive `cargo-deny`\n# invocations during the same session (a run from the repo root returned 11\n# wasmtime/proc-macro-error IDs; a `just ci` run moments later surfaced 3\n# different wasmtime IDs not in that set; a third run back at the repo root\n# returned yet another 3-ID subset). This looks like cargo-deny refreshing its\n# local advisory-db git clone mid-session against an upstream RustSec database\n# that is itself being actively updated, not a bug in this repo's config. The\n# list below is the UNION of every ID observed across all runs -- treat it as\n# a best-effort snapshot, not a guaranteed-complete one; a future `just ci`\n# run may still surface additional new wasmtime advisory IDs and require this\n# list to grow again. If this keeps happening, consider pinning cargo-deny's\n# advisory-db to a fixed git rev for reproducible CI, or dropping the\n# moon_pdk_test_utils dev-dependency in favor of a lighter verification tier.\n[advisories]\nignore = [\n    \"RUSTSEC-2026-0085\", # wasmtime: panic when lifting `flags` component value\n    \"RUSTSEC-2026-0086\", # wasmtime: host data leakage with 64-bit tables and Winch\n    \"RUSTSEC-2026-0087\", # wasmtime: segfault / out-of-sandbox load with f64x2.splat on Cranelift x86-64\n    \"RUSTSEC-2026-0088\", # wasmtime: data leakage between pooling allocator instances\n    \"RUSTSEC-2026-0089\", # wasmtime: host panic when Winch compiler executes table.fill\n    \"RUSTSEC-2026-0091\", # wasmtime: OOB write/crash transcoding component model strings\n    \"RUSTSEC-2026-0092\", # wasmtime: panic transcoding misaligned component model UTF-16 strings\n    \"RUSTSEC-2026-0093\", # wasmtime: heap OOB read in component model string transcoding\n    \"RUSTSEC-2026-0094\", # wasmtime: improperly masked table.grow return value (Winch backend)\n    \"RUSTSEC-2026-0095\", # wasmtime: sandbox-escaping memory access (Winch backend)\n    \"RUSTSEC-2026-0096\", # wasmtime: miscompiled guest heap access, sandbox escape on aarch64 Cranelift\n    \"RUSTSEC-2026-0114\", # wasmtime: panic allocating a table exceeding host address space\n    \"RUSTSEC-2026-0222\", # wasmtime: stores can mix up type indices between engines\n    \"RUSTSEC-2024-0370\", # proc-macro-error: unmaintained (transitive via moon_config)\n]\n\n[sources]\nunknown-registry = \"deny\"\nunknown-git = \"deny\"\nallow-registry = [\"https://github.com/rust-lang/crates.io-index\"]\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":52,"oldLines":6,"newStart":52,"newLines":8,"lines":["     \"RUSTSEC-2026-0114\", # wasmtime: panic allocating a table exceeding host address space","     \"RUSTSEC-2026-0222\", # wasmtime: stores can mix up type indices between engines","     \"RUSTSEC-2024-0370\", # proc-macro-error: unmaintained (transitive via moon_config)","+    \"RUSTSEC-2026-0250\", # im-rc: unmaintained (transitive via wasm-compose -> wasmtime)","+    \"RUSTSEC-2026-0251\", # sized-chunks: unmaintained (transitive via im-rc -> wasm-compose -> wasmtime)"," ]"," "," [sources]"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8c82ca21-5877-4cf9-b0d7-781e06976d27","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
