{"parentUuid":"e095e706-00c3-4f63-913a-97d341b64c9c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeFHqYSmGDXYZqtKrc2N4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":775,"cache_read_input_tokens":370583,"output_tokens":1971,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1374},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":775,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1971,"cache_read_input_tokens":370583,"cache_creation_input_tokens":775,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":775},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeFHqWtW3DUQ1J7e3rFFw","type":"assistant","uuid":"c18674a0-d62c-45ec-8ab8-c2a4d8ad3249","timestamp":"2026-08-21T04:50:22.348Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"c18674a0-d62c-45ec-8ab8-c2a4d8ad3249","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeFHqYSmGDXYZqtKrc2N4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Good question — a few things going on, not a plugin gap:\n\n**What IS being leveraged:**\n- Moon's own task-level cache is working — you can see it in the output (`(cached, <hash>)`) for every crate whose inputs didn't change. That's why `fmt-check` finishes in ~100ms.\n- CI uses `Swatinem/rust-cache@v2` (registry + target-dir caching keyed off `Cargo.lock`).\n\n**Why this particular run was slow anyway:** the `h2` bump + `deny.toml` edit changed `Cargo.lock`, which invalidates the cache for every crate depending on it — including `callisto-moon`, which drags in `wasmtime`/`extism`/`warpgate`/`moon_pdk_test_utils` as dev-dependencies. That's a genuinely huge dependency tree to compile from scratch, and it's why `callisto-moon:lint` alone took 23 minutes. This isn't a missing-plugin problem, it's the unavoidable cost of a lockfile change plus one crate's outsized dev-dependency tree.\n\n**Separately:** the earlier `cargo nextest run --workspace` stall (16+ min at ~0.1s CPU) was not a compile — that's actually stuck, not slow. That's the same issue from before, unrelated to caching.\n\n**What we're *not* using that would help:** `sccache` — a shared compilation cache keyed per-crate rather than by whole-lockfile fingerprint, so a `Cargo.lock` bump wouldn't force a full rebuild of unrelated large dependency trees. Want me to set that up? It's a real environment change (new tool, `~/.cargo/config.toml` edit) so I'd rather ask first than just do it.\n\nCI is still running on the PR — I'll report once it lands."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":775,"cache_read_input_tokens":370583,"output_tokens":1971,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1374},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":775,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1971,"cache_read_input_tokens":370583,"cache_creation_input_tokens":775,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":775},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeFHqWtW3DUQ1J7e3rFFw","type":"assistant","uuid":"8b916c1b-6890-4448-948a-24e4f4786f86","timestamp":"2026-08-21T04:50:27.859Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
